WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.140
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.240 --> 00:01.920
- Why do you hate me? Just tell me.

3
00:01.920 --> 00:03.160
- I don’t hate you.

4
00:03.280 --> 00:05.080
- What do you have to earn my acceptance?

5
00:05.080 --> 00:06.000
- What do you want me to do?

6
00:06.000 --> 00:07.600
- Compete against me in a shooting match.

7
00:07.680 --> 00:09.600
- If you win, I’ll accept you.

8
00:09.840 --> 00:10.600
- Don’t be afraid.

9
00:10.960 --> 00:11.560
- Stay focused.

10
00:14.080 --> 00:15.080
- You knew that you could never beat me,

11
00:15.080 --> 00:16.200
- but you didn’t give up.

12
00:16.360 --> 00:17.800
- I don’t accept you for your skills,

13
00:18.080 --> 00:19.200
- but I accept you for your spirit.

14
00:21.720 --> 00:22.520
- Wait for me.

15
00:22.680 --> 00:24.440
- Go away. We are closed.

16
00:24.520 --> 00:25.720
- You can close the application.

17
00:25.720 --> 00:26.960
- I already applied.

18
00:27.360 --> 00:28.560
- Where did you get that confidence?

19
00:28.600 --> 00:33.280
- So? Am I in?

20
00:33.720 --> 00:36.120
- You can’t beat me in everything, Zoe.

21
00:37.320 --> 00:38.360
- I love you.

22
01:08.520 --> 01:08.920
Hey!

23
01:14.440 --> 01:15.120
Suea Yai.

24
01:23.040 --> 01:23.800
Dad.

25
03:11.080 --> 03:14.320
They are not for show. They are for sale.

26
03:14.520 --> 03:17.160
Come and take a look.

27
03:17.280 --> 03:18.840
The eggplants are fresh.

28
03:19.360 --> 03:23.520
Look. The flies from your shop are flying around my vegetables.

29
03:23.520 --> 03:28.000
That’s why no one wants to buy my vegetables.

30
03:29.440 --> 03:30.080
Hey.

31
03:30.200 --> 03:30.560
Hello.

32
03:30.560 --> 03:31.720
The flies are from your shop.

33
03:33.000 --> 03:33.920
I’m here to collect debts.

34
03:33.920 --> 03:34.720
- I’m here to collect debts. - Come and take a look. The vegetables are fresh.

35
03:34.720 --> 03:38.320
Come and take a look. The vegetables are fresh.

36
03:39.280 --> 03:39.800
Hello.

37
03:40.480 --> 03:41.000
- Hello. - Come and look at the vegetables.

38
03:41.000 --> 03:43.880
Come and look at the vegetables.

39
03:44.360 --> 03:45.400
I’m here to collect debts.

40
03:47.440 --> 03:48.880
Don’t take the bad ones.

41
03:49.640 --> 03:51.760
Hongsen sent me to collect debts.

42
04:03.760 --> 04:06.400
Collect debts? I haven’t sold anything today.

43
04:06.640 --> 04:09.160
See and pick what you like.

44
04:09.160 --> 04:14.080
There are plenty. Pick the pretty ones.

45
04:23.440 --> 04:24.800
Here is the money I owe you.

46
04:25.160 --> 04:25.720
Take it.

47
04:27.520 --> 04:30.640
You know I’m not here only to collect the money.

48
04:31.880 --> 04:34.680
Otherwise, you wouldn’t be avoiding me.

49
04:39.080 --> 04:41.160
I heard that you were there that night.

50
04:42.920 --> 04:44.320
Tell me what you saw.

51
04:45.880 --> 04:47.240
Tell me everything.

52
04:48.280 --> 04:49.000
Every detail.

53
04:51.840 --> 04:52.840
You saw it, didn’t you?

54
04:54.400 --> 04:55.680
You saw who shot Suea Yai.

55
05:04.320 --> 05:05.240
It’s not working.

56
05:08.880 --> 05:09.720
Den.

57
05:11.640 --> 05:12.120
What?

58
05:13.480 --> 05:14.560
The money.

59
05:22.800 --> 05:24.200
You collected the debts?

60
05:24.360 --> 05:25.640
I not only collected the debts,

61
05:26.760 --> 05:27.840
but I also got snacks from them.

62
05:28.120 --> 05:29.040
Den, have a bite.

63
05:31.040 --> 05:31.680
Thanks.

64
05:32.240 --> 05:34.320
If you want me to collect debts again, just tell me.

65
05:35.640 --> 05:36.640
I’m now an expert.

66
05:38.080 --> 05:39.360
Stop boasting.

67
05:42.960 --> 05:43.560
Sen.

68
05:44.040 --> 05:44.680
I collected…

69
06:33.120 --> 06:33.960
I want to give you the sweet.

70
06:34.880 --> 06:36.280
I got it when I went to collect debts.

71
06:40.520 --> 06:41.240
Keep it.

72
06:43.600 --> 06:44.920
But I saved it for you.

73
06:46.280 --> 06:47.440
Are you sure you don’t want to eat it?

74
06:49.720 --> 06:50.640
It smells good.

75
06:51.200 --> 06:52.360
It’s so sweet.

76
06:53.160 --> 06:54.040
It’s also delicious.

77
06:55.400 --> 06:56.200
Look at its texture.

78
06:59.720 --> 07:00.640
It looks tasty.

79
07:14.600 --> 07:15.480
So sweet.

80
07:17.080 --> 07:17.960
Go away.

81
07:24.400 --> 07:26.160
I collected the debts. Aren’t you going to compliment me?

82
07:29.800 --> 07:30.920
I told you to go away.

83
07:37.720 --> 07:38.600
Are you alright?

84
07:40.680 --> 07:42.760
You have been very quiet since you got back from the market.

85
07:44.000 --> 07:45.240
Why? Did the owner of the photo studio…

86
07:45.240 --> 07:46.360
I want to be alone.

87
07:56.200 --> 07:58.000
If you want to talk, you can tell me.

88
07:58.280 --> 07:59.000
You can trust me.

89
08:03.960 --> 08:05.040
You can really trust me.

90
08:22.640 --> 08:23.880
I still can’t find Yong.

91
08:24.080 --> 08:26.000
I don’t know where your brother is.

92
08:26.320 --> 08:27.120
I’m sure he’s in the hood.

93
08:27.280 --> 08:28.480
Keep looking for him.

94
08:29.240 --> 08:32.480
Don’t let anyone know that Yong is my brother.

95
08:32.640 --> 08:33.840
You know the hood is run by him.

96
08:34.360 --> 08:34.920
Sure.

97
08:37.200 --> 08:37.720
Zoe.

98
08:38.880 --> 08:39.240
Yes?

99
08:39.640 --> 08:40.800
Where have you been?

100
08:41.040 --> 08:43.160
Sorry. I won’t be late again.

101
08:43.800 --> 08:44.760
I need to get to work.

102
08:46.120 --> 08:47.320
Since he joined our gang,

103
08:48.320 --> 08:50.240
he sneaks out every morning.

104
08:50.640 --> 08:51.880
I don’t know where he goes.

105
08:52.120 --> 08:53.280
When I ask him about his personal life,

106
08:53.280 --> 08:54.440
he refuses to talk.

107
08:54.760 --> 08:55.960
He’s so damn secretive.

108
08:56.560 --> 08:58.080
Did you check his background?

109
09:05.200 --> 09:06.240
Thank you, Zeng.

110
09:23.920 --> 09:24.480
Zeng.

111
09:26.000 --> 09:27.800
Can I take leave the day after tomorrow?

112
09:29.080 --> 09:30.280
I have an errand to do.

113
09:30.840 --> 09:31.480
What errand?

114
09:34.400 --> 09:35.520
It’s…

115
09:37.160 --> 09:37.960
It’s a personal errand.

116
09:38.200 --> 09:39.120
What personal errand?

117
09:39.680 --> 09:40.800
I said it’s a personal errand.

118
09:41.760 --> 09:44.360
Isn’t it obvious? It’s personal.

119
09:45.120 --> 09:47.640
It means it’s none of other people’s business.

120
09:48.000 --> 09:49.000
Are you saying I’m being nosy?

121
09:49.760 --> 09:51.040
I wasn’t thinking that.

122
09:51.760 --> 09:53.440
But after hearing you say it,

123
09:54.360 --> 09:55.400
I started to see it that way.

124
09:57.520 --> 09:59.240
So I have no right to know your personal life?

125
09:59.840 --> 10:01.240
I’m your gang’s leader.

126
10:01.840 --> 10:03.000
Besides knowing that you are a temple boy,

127
10:03.320 --> 10:05.000
I don’t know a damn thing about you.

128
10:08.920 --> 10:10.400
I don’t know anything about you either.

129
10:11.000 --> 10:13.560
And I don’t want to know too.

130
10:15.080 --> 10:18.640
My gang, we are like a family.

131
10:19.040 --> 10:20.240
We tell each other everything.

132
10:20.520 --> 10:22.320
We have each other’s back.

133
10:22.920 --> 10:24.600
If you can’t do that,

134
10:25.400 --> 10:27.000
you can’t be a part of my family.

135
10:31.800 --> 10:32.640
I don’t approve your leave.

136
10:36.040 --> 10:38.040
I’m docking your pay for being late today.

137
11:32.280 --> 11:33.040
What are you doing?

138
11:39.920 --> 11:41.200
Good morning, Father.

139
11:45.640 --> 11:46.520
Why didn’t you tell me?

140
11:47.120 --> 11:48.720
That you’re helping Father with the morning alms.

141
11:51.680 --> 11:53.040
Would you believe me if I told you?

142
11:54.000 --> 11:54.880
Why wouldn’t I believe you?

143
11:57.320 --> 11:58.440
You are prejudiced against me.

144
11:59.240 --> 12:00.200
In your eyes, I’m always wrong.

145
12:00.800 --> 12:01.520
Am I right?

146
12:02.400 --> 12:03.960
That’s why you secretly followed me.

147
12:05.760 --> 12:06.560
You’re right.

148
12:06.800 --> 12:07.920
I encountered someone like this before.

149
12:08.040 --> 12:10.240
If I’m prejudiced against you, you should try to earn my trust.

150
12:10.400 --> 12:12.160
Those who regularly pay respect…

151
12:12.960 --> 12:14.200
I’m not acting secretive.

152
12:14.800 --> 12:15.880
But you are prejudiced against me.

153
12:16.040 --> 12:17.600
So you think I’m acting secretive.

154
12:17.600 --> 12:18.800
You are acting secretive.

155
12:18.800 --> 12:19.480
You’re prejudiced.

156
12:19.480 --> 12:22.240
When you offer alms, don’t act secretive.

157
12:22.240 --> 12:22.640
I’m not acting secretive.

158
12:22.640 --> 12:23.000
You are acting secretive.

159
12:23.000 --> 12:23.360
Hey.

160
12:24.440 --> 12:27.080
You two go act secretive somewhere else.

161
12:27.280 --> 12:28.240
So I can give them a blessing.

162
12:28.920 --> 12:29.680
I’m sorry.

163
12:30.800 --> 12:33.680
I wish you success and happiness.

164
12:38.800 --> 12:40.320
Father also agreed that you’re acting secretive.

165
12:40.880 --> 12:41.480
You will go to hell.

166
12:43.560 --> 12:44.680
Now, you are in my gang.

167
12:44.680 --> 12:45.720
I need to know about your life.

168
12:45.720 --> 12:47.560
Who are you? How did you end up as a temple boy?

169
12:47.560 --> 12:49.000
What have you done? Tell me.

170
12:49.000 --> 12:50.040
Am I being interviewed?

171
12:50.040 --> 12:50.960
Don’t dodge my questions.

172
12:51.480 --> 12:52.200
Tell me.

173
12:52.720 --> 12:54.360
Otherwise, I will think that you don’t trust me.

174
12:55.360 --> 12:56.760
I just have no place to live.

175
12:57.760 --> 12:59.160
So I asked Father to live at the temple.

176
12:59.960 --> 13:02.080
What about your parents, siblings, or family?

177
13:08.880 --> 13:09.760
I’m not trying to be nosy.

178
13:10.760 --> 13:14.400
But if there’s anything I can help you with, I want to help.

179
13:15.720 --> 13:17.600
Everyone in our gang has problems.

180
13:18.120 --> 13:19.960
Don’t tell me that you have no problems.

181
13:23.680 --> 13:28.040
If you keep your problems to yourself, why did you join our gang?

182
13:29.360 --> 13:30.600
The whole world doesn’t understand us.

183
13:31.320 --> 13:32.800
Only people like us understand each other.

184
13:38.600 --> 13:40.040
I just want you to know.

185
13:42.720 --> 13:44.240
that you are not alone, Zoe.

186
13:53.880 --> 13:55.320
It’s not that I don’t trust you.

187
13:57.440 --> 13:59.080
There’s something I don’t want to talk about.

188
14:01.360 --> 14:02.960
It’s something I just want to forget.

189
14:06.760 --> 14:07.120
Alright.

190
14:08.280 --> 14:09.520
This is good.

191
14:09.920 --> 14:11.840
At least I know that you have a problem.

192
14:12.320 --> 14:13.160
You want to forget it, right?

193
14:13.720 --> 14:15.520
Fine, I guarantee you will forget it.

194
14:15.920 --> 14:19.360
I’ll help you forget everything except me.

195
14:20.760 --> 14:21.320
Let’s go, Zoe.

196
14:21.960 --> 14:22.440
Let’s roll.

197
14:23.000 --> 14:25.240
Zeng, do I have to remember things about you?

198
14:25.240 --> 14:25.720
Watch your step, Zoe.

199
14:25.720 --> 14:26.600
Let me go.

200
14:29.760 --> 14:30.480
Damn.

201
14:32.400 --> 14:33.520
Is this a house or a shack?

202
14:38.160 --> 14:38.400
Guys.

203
14:43.200 --> 14:45.080
Why don’t you tear it down and build a new building?

204
14:45.840 --> 14:47.120
So you can live more comfortably.

205
14:47.600 --> 14:48.520
Don’t bother.

206
14:50.000 --> 14:51.840
We don’t like owing anyone.

207
14:53.760 --> 14:55.160
You came all the way here to meet me.

208
14:56.160 --> 14:57.400
What is your business with me?

209
15:09.280 --> 15:11.840
The election will be held in two months.

210
15:12.040 --> 15:15.880
I want this side of the river to be developed and have good lives like the other side.

211
15:19.240 --> 15:21.440
I want you to work for me.

212
15:22.880 --> 15:26.120
If you help me, I’ll help you in return.

213
15:26.800 --> 15:29.320
You won’t have to live in this shack and have a struggling life.

214
15:29.640 --> 15:31.800
You’ll no longer need to look over your shoulder for the cops.

215
15:33.160 --> 15:34.840
You already have Zeng working for you.

216
15:36.920 --> 15:38.640
Zeng has his hands full already.

217
15:39.520 --> 15:41.600
I also don’t want to involve him in this.

218
15:43.320 --> 15:44.760
I want you, Hongsen.

219
15:45.560 --> 15:47.840
I’m sure you can help me with this.

220
15:48.600 --> 15:50.360
Your name is well-known.

221
15:51.480 --> 15:53.960
Especially what you did to Suea Yai.

222
16:05.600 --> 16:07.600
We are not capable enough to work for you.

223
16:10.120 --> 16:13.800
You don’t get an opportunity like this every day.

224
16:14.920 --> 16:18.600
You're the first person I've come to personally with this opportunity.

225
16:35.560 --> 16:36.720
Don’t be so hasty.

226
16:37.640 --> 16:39.400
They are country folks.

227
16:39.960 --> 16:40.920
You should not rush them.

228
16:49.920 --> 16:50.840
Is he your new member?

229
16:58.480 --> 16:58.880
Fine.

230
17:00.080 --> 17:01.360
I’ll give you time to think.

231
17:02.640 --> 17:03.640
Don’t keep me waiting for too long.

232
17:06.120 --> 17:07.720
People from Phra Nakorn don’t like waiting.

233
17:28.960 --> 17:30.240
I want you, Hongsen.

234
17:30.960 --> 17:33.000
Your name is well-known.

235
17:33.880 --> 17:36.280
Especially what you did to Suea Yai.

236
17:39.360 --> 17:40.560
What did he talk about?

237
17:48.840 --> 17:49.320
Yong.

238
17:51.640 --> 17:52.080
Yes.

239
17:54.480 --> 17:55.760
You studied accounting, right?

240
17:58.680 --> 18:00.160
You will take care of our debtor records.

241
18:01.000 --> 18:03.720
You will handle our gang’s accounting.

242
18:05.960 --> 18:07.280
Won’t Den be upset with me?

243
18:07.520 --> 18:08.240
He’s managing it.

244
18:08.520 --> 18:09.400
He made mistakes.

245
18:10.400 --> 18:12.200
That’s why I need to find someone else to do it.

246
18:15.640 --> 18:15.960
Sure.

247
18:20.600 --> 18:21.320
Hongsen.

248
18:33.600 --> 18:38.280
Boss Aang mentioned what you did to Suea Yai.

249
18:39.520 --> 18:40.360
What did you do?

250
18:43.600 --> 18:45.440
I’m in your gang now.

251
18:45.800 --> 18:49.440
I just want to boast about it to other people.

252
19:08.280 --> 19:09.280
hat’s his problem?

253
19:16.840 --> 19:17.480
Yong.

254
19:18.480 --> 19:19.680
here’s your head at?

255
19:20.840 --> 19:21.520
I’m sorry, Den.

256
19:25.000 --> 19:25.480
Den.

257
19:27.360 --> 19:30.880
Boss Aang mentioned that Sen did something to Suea Yai.

258
19:31.120 --> 19:31.760
What did he do?

259
19:32.680 --> 19:33.800
Shut up.

260
19:34.440 --> 19:36.000
This is not something you can mention casually.

261
19:36.480 --> 19:37.240
Why, Den?

262
19:38.160 --> 19:39.840
Is it that serious?

263
19:45.080 --> 19:45.600
Yong.

264
19:49.240 --> 19:50.480
Where have you been hiding?

265
19:50.880 --> 19:53.360
I just remember that you have a close friend opening a salon here.

266
19:54.240 --> 19:54.480
Hey.

267
19:55.440 --> 19:56.200
What are you doing?

268
19:59.080 --> 19:59.880
Why are you with him?

269
20:01.000 --> 20:01.760
I…

270
20:06.880 --> 20:07.680
Forget it. Come with me.

271
20:14.280 --> 20:15.080
You are looking for Mom?

272
20:15.920 --> 20:17.480
Why are you looking for her?

273
20:18.040 --> 20:18.960
She left us when we were young.

274
20:19.160 --> 20:20.760
She didn’t love us. Did you forget that?

275
20:21.240 --> 20:22.200
No.

276
20:23.240 --> 20:24.720
f you don’t want to look for her, fine.

277
20:25.000 --> 20:26.320
But I want to look for her.

278
20:29.360 --> 20:30.480
How did you get involved with Hongsen?

279
20:31.920 --> 20:32.760
Why are you with his man?

280
20:33.040 --> 20:34.000
He promises he will help me.

281
20:34.520 --> 20:37.360
Yong, I cut Hongsen off a long time ago.

282
20:37.760 --> 20:38.840
Why do you ask for his help?

283
20:39.200 --> 20:40.160
How does that have anything to do with me?

284
20:41.720 --> 20:45.440
Back then, I didn’t want to know why you and he stopped being friends.

285
20:47.160 --> 20:48.360
But now I want to know.

286
20:52.560 --> 20:53.320
You don’t need to know it.

287
20:53.480 --> 20:54.120
Come on. Let’s go home.

288
20:54.240 --> 20:54.840
Wait.

289
20:55.960 --> 20:56.760
Is it about Dad?

290
20:58.520 --> 20:59.880
That’s why you stopped being his friend.

291
21:03.080 --> 21:05.200
You told me that Dad was drunk driving and ran his car into a tree.

292
21:05.360 --> 21:06.200
Is it true?

293
21:12.280 --> 21:13.120
It’s not true, is it?

294
21:15.160 --> 21:16.480
Have you been lying to me all this time?

295
21:16.800 --> 21:17.560
Yong.

296
21:17.760 --> 21:19.440
Don’t I have the right to know how he died?

297
21:20.320 --> 21:22.800
If you lied to me because I was young, I can understand that.

298
21:23.360 --> 21:24.720
But I’m an adult now.

299
21:26.120 --> 21:27.640
Isn’t it time for me to know the truth?

300
21:39.720 --> 21:41.200
Hongsen killed Dad.

301
21:54.800 --> 21:55.360
Sen.

302
22:03.760 --> 22:05.440
Stop it.

303
22:06.720 --> 22:07.600
Remember me.

304
22:08.400 --> 22:09.680
I’m Hongsen.

305
22:09.880 --> 22:10.480
Asshole!

306
22:13.280 --> 22:13.680
Come on.

307
22:13.680 --> 22:14.080
Zeng.

308
22:16.120 --> 22:19.880
A big shot contacted me about a job.

309
22:20.600 --> 22:24.240
If I pull it off, he will take good care of me.

310
22:25.320 --> 22:26.160
Who is he?

311
22:26.560 --> 22:27.280
I don’t know.

312
22:28.040 --> 22:29.240
The lieutenant is the middleman.

313
22:29.800 --> 22:31.560
Are you going to work for him without knowing who he is?

314
22:32.440 --> 22:33.200
Are you crazy?

315
22:39.880 --> 22:40.200
Zeng.

316
22:41.720 --> 22:44.320
Gangsters like us need powerful people in our corner.

317
22:44.800 --> 22:45.840
So we can grow more powerful.

318
22:47.000 --> 22:51.240
I won’t let low-ranked cops keep picking on us.

319
22:57.600 --> 23:00.240
Did my dad know about this?

320
23:04.880 --> 23:05.480
No.

321
23:06.800 --> 23:07.720
I didn’t tell him.

322
23:08.440 --> 23:09.720
You can’t tell him either.

323
23:11.960 --> 23:15.080
I told you because you are my best friend.

324
23:21.000 --> 23:21.880
Come on.

325
23:23.720 --> 23:24.920
Trust me.

326
23:27.360 --> 23:28.200
Fine.

327
23:29.200 --> 23:30.080
You’d better be careful.

328
23:31.960 --> 23:32.520
I will.

329
23:33.160 --> 23:34.200
This is more like it.

330
23:34.720 --> 23:36.280
We always have each other’s backs.

331
23:37.120 --> 23:38.600
You never listen to my warning anyway.

332
23:57.920 --> 24:00.400
Come to meet me at our meeting point tonight.

333
24:01.520 --> 24:02.000
As we have agreed.

334
24:18.920 --> 24:19.440
Zeng.

335
24:20.640 --> 24:21.120
Dad.

336
24:21.840 --> 24:22.480
What are you doing?

337
24:23.160 --> 24:24.280
Are you working with the police?

338
24:26.400 --> 24:27.400
It’s not your business.

339
24:28.400 --> 24:29.000
Go home.

340
24:29.280 --> 24:29.800
Dad.

341
24:31.640 --> 24:32.200
Go.

342
25:33.440 --> 25:33.840
Hey.

343
25:48.600 --> 25:49.280
Dad.

344
25:56.720 --> 25:58.120
Hongsen, asshole.

345
26:04.960 --> 26:06.560
F*ck you, Hongsen.

346
26:07.520 --> 26:09.360
How could you do this to my dad?

347
26:09.840 --> 26:11.080
Son of a b*tch.

348
26:13.840 --> 26:14.800
Stop it.

349
26:15.680 --> 26:17.000
Stop it.

350
26:19.320 --> 26:20.640
Let me go.

351
26:20.640 --> 26:21.160
Stop it.

352
26:21.400 --> 26:23.240
Son of a b*tch. Why the hell are you stopping me?

353
26:24.880 --> 26:25.320
Scumbag.

354
26:26.320 --> 26:27.560
Why did you kill my dad?

355
26:28.040 --> 26:28.440
Why?

356
26:29.600 --> 26:31.840
He was like a father to you.

357
26:32.640 --> 26:33.840
Scumbag.

358
26:34.040 --> 26:34.880
Asshole.

359
26:38.280 --> 26:40.120
I didn’t tell you about this because you were young.

360
26:41.120 --> 26:42.360
You really hated gangsters.

361
26:48.240 --> 26:49.920
I couldn’t bring myself to tell you the truth.

362
26:52.040 --> 26:55.600
I promised Dad that I would take care of you and wouldn’t hurt you.

363
26:58.600 --> 26:59.600
You are hurting me.

364
27:02.360 --> 27:03.360
You lied to me.

365
27:06.520 --> 27:08.240
You acted like I was not his son.

366
27:08.400 --> 27:09.040
Yong.

367
27:19.760 --> 27:20.560
I’m sorry.

368
27:23.240 --> 27:24.400
Now you know the truth.

369
27:26.400 --> 27:27.840
Are you still going back to Hongsen?

370
27:36.800 --> 27:37.920
Leave me alone.

371
27:44.680 --> 27:45.400
Yong.

372
28:29.280 --> 28:29.840
Hey.

373
28:32.000 --> 28:33.080
Don’t be afraid.

374
28:41.520 --> 28:45.280
Your outfit is not bad, but your hair is a mess.

375
28:45.640 --> 28:47.600
Put oil on your hair. Girls like it.

376
29:16.640 --> 29:18.200
Den told me that Zeng took you away.

377
29:19.280 --> 29:20.120
I’m here to take you back.

378
29:25.640 --> 29:26.840
Is there anything you want to tell me?

379
29:33.720 --> 29:35.040
Can I trust you?

380
29:37.680 --> 29:38.720
If I can trust you,

381
29:41.880 --> 29:43.080
you can trust me.

382
30:23.000 --> 30:23.360
Hey.

383
30:24.280 --> 30:25.040
What’s wrong?

384
30:25.720 --> 30:26.640
Why the long face?

385
30:29.600 --> 30:30.560
I want to be alone.

386
30:37.080 --> 30:38.200
You said you wanted to be alone.

387
30:38.720 --> 30:40.200
But you came to a crowded place like this.

388
30:41.480 --> 30:42.720
You don’t mean what you say.

389
30:51.880 --> 30:53.000
Do you have any siblings?

390
30:55.760 --> 30:56.400
I’m an only child.

391
30:57.480 --> 30:57.920
Why?

392
31:02.120 --> 31:03.280
I have a little brother.

393
31:05.320 --> 31:08.800
I want to do my best to take care of him like I promised my dad.

394
31:10.400 --> 31:11.440
He doesn’t like gangsters.

395
31:11.600 --> 31:12.960
I sent him to live with Grandma.

396
31:15.000 --> 31:16.200
So he could grow up to be a good man.

397
31:18.120 --> 31:19.800
He wouldn’t end up being a gangster like me.

398
31:26.640 --> 31:27.480
But you know what?

399
31:30.320 --> 31:33.360
I’m the one who hurt him the most.

400
31:37.120 --> 31:37.920
Isn’t it ironic?

401
31:45.560 --> 31:46.800
Did you do that with good intentions?

402
31:47.880 --> 31:50.720
If your answer is yes, then you have nothing to regret.

403
31:53.600 --> 31:54.640
You did your best.

404
31:56.240 --> 31:58.240
You should let him choose and make decisions for himself.

405
31:58.880 --> 31:59.840
You can’t force him.

406
32:02.720 --> 32:03.360
So…

407
32:04.440 --> 32:05.640
are you telling me to let go?

408
32:05.960 --> 32:06.480
Yes.

409
32:16.880 --> 32:17.920
Your shoulders are big.

410
32:19.520 --> 32:20.520
You must have been carrying a lot of things.

411
32:25.800 --> 32:26.480
I’ve got to go.

412
32:26.880 --> 32:28.120
I need to do the shopping for Cheng.

413
32:29.280 --> 32:31.240
You are a boss. Don’t be a slacker.

414
32:32.400 --> 32:33.640
You’re f*cking annoying.

415
32:44.400 --> 32:45.800
Where did he go?

416
33:11.480 --> 33:12.280
What are you stressed about?

417
33:13.480 --> 33:14.800
You look totally defeated.

418
33:24.200 --> 33:25.400
You are hiding something from me, aren’t you?

419
33:27.280 --> 33:28.760
How could I dare hide anything from you?

420
33:31.520 --> 33:33.000
There’s no way you can hide anything from me.

421
33:38.760 --> 33:39.600
You knew?

422
33:47.760 --> 33:49.080
The money that you claimed to collect from debtors.

423
33:50.160 --> 33:51.440
It’s your money, right?

424
33:55.960 --> 33:57.840
Do you think I’ve never done it?

425
33:58.960 --> 33:59.720
I’ve done it all.

426
34:05.320 --> 34:06.200
When you were with Suea Yai?

427
34:13.320 --> 34:14.200
Why are you asking about him?

428
34:15.720 --> 34:16.280
Nothing.

429
34:17.440 --> 34:18.680
I’m just curious.

430
34:19.280 --> 34:21.480
I heard Boss Aang talked about your history with Suea Yai.

431
34:23.120 --> 34:24.880
Why have you never told me about it?

432
34:25.320 --> 34:26.800
You have heard about it, haven’t you?

433
34:30.440 --> 34:31.280
Did you really kill him?

434
34:47.680 --> 34:48.800
I was framed.

435
34:49.920 --> 34:50.880
I took the job

436
34:51.440 --> 34:52.800
because I wanted to have powerful people backing me.

437
34:53.200 --> 34:55.520
I didn’t want to be a stooge for the cops for the rest of my life.

438
34:56.080 --> 34:57.840
If I knew the target was Suea Yai,

439
34:58.240 --> 34:59.360
I would have never taken the job.

440
34:59.880 --> 35:01.560
I would never betray him.

441
35:02.360 --> 35:03.880
Did you take the job to kill me?

442
35:05.480 --> 35:05.840
No.

443
35:06.400 --> 35:07.320
Don’t lower your gun.

444
35:09.040 --> 35:10.080
They are watching you.

445
35:14.720 --> 35:18.160
They told me that this would be my last job.

446
35:20.480 --> 35:21.400
Now they are done with me,

447
35:22.560 --> 35:24.160
they want to get rid of me like I was a dog.

448
35:25.720 --> 35:27.080
They hired you to kill me

449
35:28.240 --> 35:30.200
because I know too much about them.

450
35:32.800 --> 35:34.080
I didn’t know that the target was you.

451
35:34.600 --> 35:36.200
Hongsen, listen to me.

452
35:38.160 --> 35:39.640
They will kill us both.

453
35:41.400 --> 35:46.360
Our lives will never get better as long as they are still here.

454
35:50.720 --> 35:51.440
Dad.

455
36:03.640 --> 36:06.400
He was shot by a sniper.

456
36:14.960 --> 36:15.560
What’s wrong?

457
36:22.560 --> 36:23.440
I…

458
36:25.600 --> 36:26.800
I think we should go back.

459
36:42.960 --> 36:43.720
Boss.

460
36:45.120 --> 36:46.000
Why are you still up?

461
36:47.800 --> 36:50.680
Don’t tell me that you stayed up waiting for me?

462
36:53.040 --> 36:54.400
You left it at Cheng’s shop.

463
36:55.440 --> 36:56.800
I followed you to return it.

464
36:57.640 --> 36:59.040
But I saw that you were busy.

465
36:59.280 --> 37:00.520
So I didn’t give it back.

466
37:44.920 --> 37:45.480
Zeng.

467
37:49.080 --> 37:50.640
You saw me with a cop, right?

468
37:57.520 --> 38:00.320
Do you know how a snitch usually ends up?

469
38:03.000 --> 38:04.360
They either end up dead or in prison.

470
38:05.440 --> 38:08.000
Even if you go to jail, you will be killed later anyway.

471
38:08.440 --> 38:09.360
I’m not working for them.

472
38:09.360 --> 38:10.480
Don’t lie to me.

473
38:11.440 --> 38:12.600
I’m telling you this.

474
38:13.400 --> 38:15.400
No matter what they promise you,

475
38:16.440 --> 38:18.320
when you are no longer useful to them,

476
38:21.200 --> 38:22.160
they won’t keep you around.

477
38:30.240 --> 38:31.440
You saw me with the police.

478
38:34.480 --> 38:35.240
It’s because of this.

479
38:47.480 --> 38:48.480
I got it when I was in there.

480
38:53.080 --> 38:54.280
I was in prison.

481
38:56.440 --> 38:58.400
They beat me so badly that I almost died.

482
38:58.760 --> 38:59.920
I needed to make some allies.

483
39:01.080 --> 39:02.560
Otherwise, I wouldn’t have been alive today.

484
39:05.360 --> 39:06.160
What about that cop?

485
39:10.800 --> 39:14.440
He was the one who arrested me.

486
39:15.160 --> 39:16.200
When I was released from prison,

487
39:16.640 --> 39:17.800
he started extorting money from me.

488
39:19.720 --> 39:21.120
If I don’t pay him every month,

489
39:22.200 --> 39:25.480
he will find a way to throw me back into prison.

490
39:30.000 --> 39:31.680
If you don’t trust me, I get it.

491
39:34.520 --> 39:35.840
I’m just an ex-con.

492
39:39.480 --> 39:40.640
You wouldn’t trust me.

493
39:43.120 --> 39:44.760
Why didn’t you tell me about it?

494
39:50.960 --> 39:52.480
It’s something I want to forget.

495
39:55.040 --> 39:56.120
You would never understand me.

496
39:57.880 --> 39:59.000
If I don’t understand you,

497
40:00.840 --> 40:02.400
no one in this world would.

498
40:06.800 --> 40:07.920
I accept you into my gang.

499
40:08.720 --> 40:10.400
It means you are now a part of my family.

500
40:11.360 --> 40:15.040
Family members don’t have secrets from each other.

501
40:16.800 --> 40:18.800
I don’t care if you are an ex-con.

502
40:19.560 --> 40:23.120
My point is that I trust you.

503
40:24.880 --> 40:25.440
What about you?

504
40:26.880 --> 40:28.000
Can I trust you?

505
40:35.480 --> 40:36.840
Look at me in the eyes

506
40:38.320 --> 40:39.240
and tell me.

507
40:40.720 --> 40:42.200
Can I trust you?

508
40:46.720 --> 40:49.720
You can trust me.

509
40:56.240 --> 40:56.760
Good.

510
40:58.760 --> 40:59.600
That’s all.

511
41:01.640 --> 41:02.160
Come on.

512
41:12.680 --> 41:13.200
Let’s go.

513
41:13.520 --> 41:14.240
Let’s take a shower.

514
41:14.840 --> 41:15.360
Take a shower?

515
41:15.440 --> 41:15.720
Yes.

516
41:16.480 --> 41:17.360
We are half naked.

517
41:17.360 --> 41:18.280
We need to take a shower.

518
41:18.920 --> 41:19.240
Come on.

519
41:20.920 --> 41:21.920
Right.

520
41:27.720 --> 41:28.360
Zoe.

521
41:28.920 --> 41:29.680
What were you arrested for?

522
41:31.200 --> 41:31.640
Drugs.

523
41:32.520 --> 41:33.720
I was set up.

524
41:33.880 --> 41:35.480
Why can't my lottery predictions be this accurate?

525
41:35.840 --> 41:38.040
They always use this dirty trick. They are scumbags.

526
41:38.840 --> 41:39.720
I’m so pissed.

527
41:41.680 --> 41:42.600
Are you going to take a shower alone?

528
41:42.600 --> 41:43.760
Go get the water bowl behind you.

529
41:56.960 --> 41:57.760
Give me the soap.

530
41:58.120 --> 41:59.480
You’ve been wetting your body for a while.

531
41:59.480 --> 42:01.360
Are you taking a shower without applying soap?

532
42:01.360 --> 42:02.080
You are nagging so much.

533
42:02.080 --> 42:03.320
Here. Take it.

534
42:21.040 --> 42:22.200
He’s smiling cutely, right?

535
42:24.640 --> 42:25.640
He looks happy.

536
42:26.160 --> 42:26.840
I envy him.

537
42:27.520 --> 42:30.040
He was forced to take the picture.

538
42:30.320 --> 42:33.520
Before he smiled like this, his mom hit him several times.

539
42:34.280 --> 42:38.800
After I took his picture, he kicked my glass cabinet, broke it, and ran away.

540
42:41.880 --> 42:44.120
Pictures only capture a moment in their life.

541
42:45.000 --> 42:46.200
If you judged him from the picture,

542
42:47.040 --> 42:48.480
you would think that he was happy.

543
42:49.480 --> 42:50.680
But if you look carefully,

544
42:51.560 --> 42:52.800
you will see the story behind it.

545
42:53.440 --> 42:54.720
It could be something completely different.

546
42:55.560 --> 42:59.600
You can’t judge someone based on what other people see.

547
43:01.600 --> 43:03.240
What should I do?

548
43:03.600 --> 43:05.000
You need to trust your own judgement.

549
43:12.080 --> 43:13.000
Thank you.

550
43:14.120 --> 43:14.720
I’ve got to go.

551
43:15.400 --> 43:16.920
Wait. Don’t go yet.

552
43:24.960 --> 43:25.280
Hey.

553
43:27.960 --> 43:28.240
Wait.

554
43:29.160 --> 43:29.400
Go.

555
43:30.600 --> 43:30.880
Wait.

556
43:30.880 --> 43:31.320
Go.

557
43:32.520 --> 43:33.080
Stay still.

558
43:33.240 --> 43:33.960
Why are you arresting me?

559
43:34.960 --> 43:37.560
You are a gangster who causes trouble.

560
43:38.000 --> 43:39.160
You should be in jail.

561
43:39.600 --> 43:40.920
But I haven’t done anything wrong.

562
43:42.280 --> 43:43.520
You are a greenhorn.

563
43:43.920 --> 43:48.080
Since you work for Hongsen, I can easily put you in jail.

564
43:49.360 --> 43:50.040
Let me go.

565
43:51.200 --> 43:51.640
Hey.

566
43:56.320 --> 43:57.480
Do you think you are so cool?

567
43:59.680 --> 44:02.200
I’m just doing a good thing that good people would do.

568
44:02.800 --> 44:03.680
Good people?

569
44:03.960 --> 44:06.240
If you were a good person, I would be an angel.

570
44:07.440 --> 44:10.000
I don’t care about your man anymore. Now, you are my target.

571
44:12.880 --> 44:13.920
Don’t mess with me, Hong.

572
44:14.760 --> 44:15.920
This is too much.

573
44:16.520 --> 44:17.640
What charge are you arresting him for?

574
44:17.800 --> 44:18.840
What charge?

575
44:20.040 --> 44:21.200
I will come up with one.

576
44:22.640 --> 44:24.560
I’ll carefully craft it.

577
44:26.840 --> 44:27.680
Asshole, Hong.

578
44:29.240 --> 44:30.840
You think you are the real deal?

579
44:31.760 --> 44:32.680
You think you are the real deal?

580
44:36.040 --> 44:36.680
Sen.

581
44:37.640 --> 44:38.360
Let me go.

582
44:40.560 --> 44:41.880
Hey.

583
44:44.080 --> 44:46.520
What’s going on here, Inspector Yod?

584
44:56.000 --> 44:59.560
Boss Aang, don’t protect these vile gangsters.

585
45:00.560 --> 45:03.080
They may get cocky and think that they are untouchable.

586
45:04.080 --> 45:06.120
Come on, Inspector.

587
45:08.120 --> 45:09.280
They are just kids.

588
45:11.320 --> 45:13.000
They can be useful if you put them in the right job.

589
45:14.640 --> 45:17.760
Please let them go as a favor to me.

590
45:19.760 --> 45:20.960
If they cause any problem,

591
45:22.240 --> 45:24.080
I will not let them get away with it again.

592
45:37.920 --> 45:38.800
Did you see?

593
45:39.520 --> 45:42.480
I can protect you from the cops.

594
45:44.600 --> 45:46.040
Are you going to work for me?

595
45:49.000 --> 45:50.880
If I’m going to work for someone,

596
45:54.160 --> 45:55.360
I only work for big bosses.

597
45:56.280 --> 45:58.440
For someone like you, I will have to pass.

598
46:00.520 --> 46:01.160
Thank you.

599
46:14.120 --> 46:16.280
Sen, how are you doing?

600
46:18.480 --> 46:19.840
We are going to help you.

601
46:20.200 --> 46:22.160
I heard that Inspector Yod picked a fight with you.

602
46:23.040 --> 46:23.880
I’m okay.

603
46:24.480 --> 46:25.280
You should put the weapons away.

604
46:25.840 --> 46:28.360
Sen, did Boss Aang save you?

605
46:29.080 --> 46:30.800
Are you working for him?

606
46:32.160 --> 46:33.080
What is it?

607
46:38.440 --> 46:39.320
I rejected his offer.

608
46:40.520 --> 46:41.960
f you have a problem with that,

609
46:43.600 --> 46:44.640
you can leave my gang.

610
47:02.560 --> 47:03.160
Zeng.

611
47:03.960 --> 47:04.880
Did you call me here?

612
47:06.200 --> 47:06.680
Yes.

613
47:07.000 --> 47:07.680
What’s up?

614
47:12.040 --> 47:13.040
I want to ask you to go for a ride.

615
47:18.040 --> 47:18.720
Fine. Move.

616
47:19.320 --> 47:20.040
Move where?

617
47:20.360 --> 47:22.040
I’m the rider. You are a passenger.

618
47:23.240 --> 47:25.440
You asked me to go for a ride, not to take me on a ride.

619
47:26.200 --> 47:26.880
But this is my bike.

620
47:27.240 --> 47:27.560
Fine.

621
47:28.280 --> 47:29.160
I’m not going.

622
47:30.280 --> 47:30.560
Hey.

623
47:38.080 --> 47:39.120
You haven’t learned your lesson, have you?

624
47:42.880 --> 47:43.360
Bring it on.

625
47:50.560 --> 47:51.680
I lost to him again.

626
47:54.920 --> 47:56.200
If you want to ride it, do it.

627
48:01.240 --> 48:02.280
Move.

628
48:03.240 --> 48:04.400
Didn’t you say you would ride it?

629
48:04.840 --> 48:05.840
I don’t want to do it anymore.

630
48:06.440 --> 48:07.000
Move.

631
48:15.600 --> 48:16.360
Asshole.

632
48:17.040 --> 48:18.040
Are you pranking me?

633
48:19.480 --> 48:21.560
Hold tightly. My bike is powerful.

634
48:23.040 --> 48:23.800
Go.

635
49:24.520 --> 49:24.960
What do you want?

636
49:26.760 --> 49:27.520
I want to thank you

637
49:28.480 --> 49:29.600
for helping me.

638
49:30.120 --> 49:31.360
I was just passing by.

639
49:32.080 --> 49:33.360
Don’t think that you are that important.

640
49:37.960 --> 49:39.120
Your tongue is still sharp.

641
49:39.400 --> 49:40.600
So the wound is not that bad.

642
49:40.840 --> 49:41.720
I guess you can treat the wound yourself.

643
49:41.920 --> 49:45.320
Before you came in, I always treated my own wounds.

644
49:48.720 --> 49:49.480
Let me help you.

645
49:57.040 --> 49:57.640
Sit back.

646
50:39.520 --> 50:41.120
What did you eat?

647
50:53.000 --> 50:53.960
Thank you, Sen.

648
50:56.440 --> 50:58.840
You asked the owner of the photo studio about my mom.

649
51:00.320 --> 51:01.480
I thought you forgot about it.

650
51:04.080 --> 51:05.720
I just tried to keep my promise.

651
51:30.280 --> 51:31.120
I have another thing to tell you.

652
51:34.960 --> 51:35.840
I believe you.

653
51:38.120 --> 51:40.360
You told me that you didn’t kill Suea Yai.

654
51:43.600 --> 51:44.400
I believe you.

655
51:46.480 --> 51:47.680
Why do you believe me?

656
51:51.240 --> 51:52.440
I just believe in my judgment.

657
51:57.480 --> 51:59.520
You are the first one who believes me.

658
52:08.280 --> 52:08.720
Right.

659
52:09.880 --> 52:10.840
I have another thing to tell you.

660
52:16.560 --> 52:17.840
You seem to have many things to say.

661
52:20.080 --> 52:21.480
The owner of the photo studio asked me to tell you this.

662
52:22.400 --> 52:24.200
What you tried to pressure him to tell you,

663
52:25.520 --> 52:27.320
he said you should talk to Boss Aang yourself.

664
52:32.960 --> 52:35.440
If there’s anything I can help with, You can always tell me.

665
52:36.000 --> 52:37.520
I’m willing to do anything to help you.

666
52:38.400 --> 52:39.240
Anything?

667
52:42.680 --> 52:46.840
Can you tell me something about you that you haven’t told me?

668
52:51.160 --> 52:52.160
Why are you saying that?

669
53:01.080 --> 53:05.160
I promised Dad that I would take care of you and wouldn’t hurt you.

670
53:08.360 --> 53:09.440
You lied to me.

671
53:10.440 --> 53:11.760
You acted like I was not his son.

672
53:15.200 --> 53:16.200
I want to know

673
53:17.400 --> 53:20.920
if you are hiding something from me.

674
53:21.640 --> 53:25.040
You told me that I can trust you.

675
53:27.200 --> 53:28.960
Yes, you can trust me.

676
53:31.360 --> 53:32.400
So?

677
53:34.080 --> 53:35.400
Do you have anything to tell me?

678
53:37.280 --> 53:38.160
No.

679
53:48.720 --> 53:49.880
So I can trust you?

680
53:53.640 --> 53:54.800
Of course, Sen.

681
53:58.600 --> 54:05.240
I guess I need to return your trust.

682
54:32.240 --> 54:33.560
Hello, girl.

683
54:34.120 --> 54:35.520
Can I buy you some soy milk?

684
54:36.200 --> 54:37.520
Why don’t you let me buy you instead?

685
54:37.520 --> 54:39.160
I’ll also buy you a Chinese cruller.

686
54:40.160 --> 54:41.160
You should let me buy you a soy milk.

687
54:41.520 --> 54:43.960
I’m a right-hand man of Hongsen Gaoyod.

688
54:44.160 --> 54:45.760
He’s a big gangster in Thonburi.

689
54:45.760 --> 54:47.360
He’s handsome and talented.

690
54:48.120 --> 54:49.600
He is well-known.

691
54:50.640 --> 54:51.800
Let me buy you soy milk.

692
54:51.800 --> 54:53.960
I’m the right-hand man of Zeng Klookfoon.

693
54:53.960 --> 54:55.400
His father was the legendary Suea Yai.

694
54:55.600 --> 54:56.960
He’s a gangster in Phra Nakorn.

695
54:57.320 --> 54:59.640
He’s more handsome and talented.

696
55:00.000 --> 55:01.760
He is also brave and dependable.

697
55:02.520 --> 55:05.440
But my boss builds everything by himself.

698
55:05.640 --> 55:07.480
He doesn’t need his dad’s reputation.

699
55:08.520 --> 55:09.840
What’s wrong with him using his dad’s reputation?

700
55:09.920 --> 55:11.680
At least, he doesn’t have to waste his time starting from the ground up.

701
55:11.760 --> 55:12.240
Why?

702
55:12.440 --> 55:13.000
What’s your problem?

703
55:13.680 --> 55:14.040
Bring it on.

704
55:14.160 --> 55:14.640
Bring it on.

705
55:14.920 --> 55:15.520
Hey.

706
55:15.880 --> 55:17.160
You are boasting about your bosses.

707
55:17.280 --> 55:18.760
Then you should ask your bosses to hit on her instead.

708
55:22.840 --> 55:24.360
See? I lost my chance with her..

709
55:24.360 --> 55:25.080
It’s your fault.

710
55:25.080 --> 55:26.200
I missed my chance.

711
55:26.320 --> 55:27.560
Why do I always run into you?

712
55:30.880 --> 55:32.000
What the hell are you looking at?

713
55:33.560 --> 55:37.200
- You haven’t told me why Zeng dragged you to talk that day.

714
55:37.360 --> 55:38.640
- I challenge you to a basketball game.

715
55:39.120 --> 55:42.880
- If you lose, you will submit to me.

716
55:43.880 --> 55:45.880
- Do you want me to win or lose?

717
55:46.880 --> 55:47.840
- Thank you too.

718
55:48.680 --> 55:51.600
- When you are with me, I feel like anything is possible.

719
55:52.760 --> 55:54.200
- I’m so lucky to have you.
